### Ver resumen de votos de la review
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Content-Type: application/json

### GET resumen de votos con usuario autenticado (userVote -1|0|1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Upvote (value = 1) una review (requiere usuario logueado)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "value": 1
}

### Downvote (value = -1) la misma review (requiere usuario logueado)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "value": -1
}

### Quitar mi voto a esa review (requiere usuario logueado)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE


### Quitar voto otra vez: 200, deleted false si ya no existe
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Review inexistente: 200, summary y userVote en cero
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/2147483647/votes

### Votar review inexistente: 404 REVIEW_NOT_FOUND, field reviewId
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/2147483647/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":1}

### Review inexistente: 200, deleted false y summary en cero
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/2147483647/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ID fuera de SERIAL: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/2147483648/votes

### Body estricto: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (no aceptar identidad del cliente)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reviews/1/votes
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":1,"userId":2}
